{"post_stream":{"posts":[{"id":501494,"name":"donkraider","username":"donkraider","avatar_template":"/user_avatar/forum.cursor.com/donkraider/{size}/122157_2.png","created_at":"2026-09-26T08:43:56.623Z","cooked":"\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-501494-where-does-the-bug-appear-featureproduct-1\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-501494-where-does-the-bug-appear-featureproduct-1\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eWhere does the bug appear (feature/product)?\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eGrok Bot\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-501494-describe-the-bug-2\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-501494-describe-the-bug-2\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eDescribe the Bug\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eMy Grok Bot is unusable. I get two errors:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003col\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e“Can’t reach your computer. Your Bots are safe, they just can’t be loaded right now.”\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e“Can’t Reach Grok Bot’s Computer. A firewall, VPN, or proxy such as Zscaler may be blocking the connection. *.cursorvm.com”\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ol\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eI am not on a corporate network and not using Zscaler. Retry and Recover computer have not fixed it. Screenshots attached. Location: India.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-501494-steps-to-reproduce-3\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-501494-steps-to-reproduce-3\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eSteps to Reproduce\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003col\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eOpen Grok Bot.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBots do not load; “Can’t reach your computer” appears.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eClick Retry: same error.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eClick Recover computer: does not fix it.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eFully quit and reopen: now shows “Can’t Reach Grok Bot’s Computer … *.cursorvm.com”.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ol\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-501494-expected-behavior-4\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-501494-expected-behavior-4\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eExpected Behavior\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBot computer becomes reachable and my Bots load, with files and logins preserved. Could you please check my Grok Bot computer from your side and rebuild or restore it on the backend if needed?\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-501494-screenshots-screen-recordings-5\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-501494-screenshots-screen-recordings-5\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eScreenshots / Screen Recordings\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"\u003e\u003ca class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/original/3X/c/d/cd38b5e8227dd80c78ad345cf59351682e274e8d.png\" data-download-href=\"/uploads/short-url/thtnLlze4uFPy5eYzmhl4DY2jAV.png?dl=1\" title=\"Screenshot 2026-09-26 140503.png\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/original/3X/c/d/cd38b5e8227dd80c78ad345cf59351682e274e8d.png\" alt=\"Screenshot 2026-09-26 140503.png\" data-base62-sha1=\"thtnLlze4uFPy5eYzmhl4DY2jAV\" width=\"415\" height=\"500\" data-dominant-color=\"161616\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"meta\"\u003e\u003csvg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"\u003e\u003cuse href=\"#far-image\"\u003e\u003c/use\u003e\u003c/svg\u003e\u003cspan class=\"filename\"\u003eScreenshot 2026-09-26 140503.png\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"informations\"\u003e492×592 11.6 KB\u003c/span\u003e\u003csvg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"\u003e\u003cuse href=\"#discourse-expand\"\u003e\u003c/use\u003e\u003c/svg\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"\u003e\u003ca class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/original/3X/d/b/db8595750112548ef5b2c44a01ad0c408d8e575c.png\" data-download-href=\"/uploads/short-url/vjYLCklKqoXXHY7skfAUyAbzshS.png?dl=1\" title=\"Screenshot 2026-09-26 140724.png\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ug