/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eN/A (Grok Bot built-in)\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-501494-does-this-stop-you-from-using-cursor-9\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-501494-does-this-stop-you-from-using-cursor-9\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eDoes this stop you from using Cursor\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eYes - Cursor is unusable\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":1,"post_type":1,"posts_count":2,"updated_at":"2026-09-26T08:44:03.525Z","reply_count":0,"reply_to_post_number":null,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":15,"reads":4,"readers_count":3,"score":75.8,"yours":false,"topic_id":173041,"topic_slug":"grok-bot-cant-reach-your-computer-after-retry-and-recover-cursorvm-com-unreachable-windows-india","display_username":"donkraider","primary_group_name":null,"flair_name":null,"flair_url":null,"flair_bg_color":null,"flair_color":null,"flair_group_id":null,"badges_granted":[],"version":2,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"read":true,"user_title":null,"bookmarked":false,"actions_summary":[],"moderator":false,"admin":false,"staff":false,"user_id":139870,"hidden":false,"trust_level":0,"deleted_at":null,"user_deleted":false,"edit_reason":null,"can_view_edit_history":false,"wiki":false,"post_url":"/t/grok-bot-cant-reach-your-computer-after-retry-and-recover-cursorvm-com-unreachable-windows-india/173041/1","reactions":[],"current_user_reaction":null,"reaction_users_count":0,"current_user_used_main_reaction":false,"can_accept_answer":false,"can_unaccept_answer":false,"accepted_answer":false,"topic_accepted_answer":null,"can_vote":false},{"id":501507,"name":"Dean Rie","username":"deanrie","avatar_template":"/user_avatar/forum.cursor.com/deanrie/{size}/1263_2.png","created_at":"2026-09-26T09:24:07.167Z","cooked":"\u003cp\u003eHey, thanks for the report and screenshots. I can see both screens, Can’t reach your computer and the cover page with *.cursorvm.com / Zscaler.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eGood news, your Grok Bot computer on our side is working fine. Your Bots, files, and logins are all still there. The issue is that the Grok Bot app on your PC can’t reach our servers at all right now. Neither Retry nor Recover is leaving the machine, so it can’t upload anything. No need to keep clicking Recover, it won’t change anything from here. Also, the *.cursorvm.com mention in the error is misleading. The real problem is that the app can’t establish a connection.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eYour app version is also very old, and it couldn’t auto-update. The updater uses the same blocked channel. So let’s start with a clean reinstall.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003col\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eRight-click the Grok Bot icon in the system tray bottom-right near the clock and click Quit. Then open Task Manager and make sure there are no Grok Bot processes left.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDownload the latest installer from \u003ca href=\"https://cursor.com/download/bot\" class=\"inline-onebox\"\u003eCursor · Download Grok Bot\u003c/a\u003e and run it.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eOpen Grok Bot, sign in with the same account, and give it about 2 minutes.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ol\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIf it still can’t reach the computer:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003col start=\"4\"\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eIf you have an antivirus or security app with web protection or HTTPS / encrypted connection scanning enabled, for example Kaspersky, Quick Heal, ESET, Avast, AVG, Norton, Bitdefender, add Grok Bot to exclusions or temporarily disable that scanning. Then quit and reopen Grok Bot.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eOpen Command Prompt, run \u003ccode\u003ecurl.exe -sI https://api2.cursor.sh\u003c/code\u003e, and paste the output here.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eQuick test: connect your PC to your phone hotspot, quit and reopen Grok Bot, wait 2 minutes, and tell me if it loads.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ol\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAlso, do your Bots show up right now in the Grok Bot Android app? That’ll help narrow down the cause.\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":5,"post_type":1,"posts_count":2,"updated_at":"2026-09-26T09:24:07.167Z","reply_count":0,"reply_to_post_number":null,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":0,"reads":2,"readers_count":1,"score":0.4,"yours":false,"topic_id":173041,"topic_slug":"grok-bot-cant-reach-your-computer-after-retry-and-recover-cursorvm-com-unreachable-windows-india","display_username":"Dean Rie","primary_group_name":"CursorStaff","flair_name":"CursorStaff","flair_url":"https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/original/3X/a/d/ad08adc640929ae1e98be69dab1ad0844cee99a0.png","flair_bg_color":"","flair_color":"","flair_group_id":42,"badges_granted":[],"version":1,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"link_counts":[{"url":"https://cursor.com/download/bot","internal":false,"reflection":false,"title":"Cursor · Download Grok Bot","clicks":1}],"read":true,"user_title":"","bookmarked":false,"actions_summary":[],"moderator":true,"admin":true,"staff":true,"user_id":750,"hidden":false,"trust_level":4,"deleted_at":null,"user_deleted":false,"edit_reason":null,"can_view_edit_history":false,"wiki":false,"post_url":"/t/grok-bot-cant-reach-your-computer-after-retry-and-recover-cursorvm-com-unreachable-windows-india/173041/5","reactions":[],"current_user_reaction":null,"reaction_users_count":0,"current_user_used_main_reaction":false,"can_accept_answer":false,"can_unaccept_answer":false,"accepted_answer":false,"topic_accepted_answer":null}],"stream":[501494,501507]},"timeline_lookup":[[1,1]],"suggested_topics":[],"tags":[{"id":416,"name":"grok-bot","slug":"grok-bot"},{"id":408,"name":"networking","slug":"networking"}],"tags_descriptions":{},"fancy_title":"Grok Bot: \u0026ldquo;Can\u0026rsquo;t reach your computer\u0026rdquo; after Retry and Recover, *.cursorvm.com unreachable (Windows, India)","id":173041,"title":"Grok Bot: \"Can't reach your computer\" after Retry and Recover, *.cursorvm.com unrea